<title>USA: Kentucky First Bancorp to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Kentucky First Bancorp to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>CYNTHIANA, Ky. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kentucky First Bancorp Inc said on Monday that it intends to buy up to 69,431 shares or about 5 percent of its common stock.</p>
<p>The buyback program is dependent upon market conditions, the company said.</p>
</text>
